WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.11 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Renewal, scaling or exit

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Renew, scale or end each partnership on purpose, protecting the people you serve.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Review results, relationship health and fit at set points.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Plan the exit when you sign, not when it ends.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Before scaling, check what made it work.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Vanita: renew buyers who pay within 45 days at fair rates; exit any buyer asking for power-loom products.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write renewal criteria and an exit plan.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
